*.egg-info
dist
build

# Test and coverage artefacts.
# Running the test container bind-mounts ./src at /app, so anything the container
# writes into /app — coverage reports, caches, mount-point stubs — lands in ./src on
# the host and would otherwise be COPYied straight into the runtime image.
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov
**/tests
**/pytest.ini
**/.coveragerc

